@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@token = вставь_сюда_JWT_после_login

### Health Gateway
GET http://localhost:3000/health

### Login user
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "User12345"
}

### Restaurants
GET {{baseUrl}}/restaurants

### Filter restaurants
GET {{baseUrl}}/restaurants?city=Москва&price_category=medium

### Restaurant details
GET {{baseUrl}}/restaurants/1

### Menu
GET {{baseUrl}}/restaurants/1/menu

### Photos
GET {{baseUrl}}/restaurants/1/photos

### Tables
GET {{baseUrl}}/restaurants/1/tables

### Create booking
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "restaurant_id": 1,
  "table_id": 2,
  "guests_count": 4,
  "booking_start": "2026-06-25T18:00:00.000Z",
  "booking_end": "2026-06-25T20:00:00.000Z"
}

### My bookings
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookings/my
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
